 text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-ink md:text-[2.5rem]">The Gap in Policy Making</h2></section><div class="mt-8 grid gap-6 sm:grid-cols-3"><section data-visible="false" class="reveal border border-ink-tint bg-paper p-6"><h3 class="text-[13px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-gold">The Problem</h3><p class="mt-3 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal">Policy decisions made without adequate research, ground reality or stakeholder input — resulting in frameworks that fail in practice.</p></section><section data-visible="false" class="reveal border border-ink-tint bg-paper p-6"><h3 class="text-[13px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-gold">The SBC Approach</h3><p class="mt-3 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal">Evidence-based advisory grounded in research, stakeholder consultation and real-world implementation experience across business and institutional sectors.</p></section><section data-visible="false" class="reveal border border-ink-tint bg-paper p-6"><h3 class="text-[13px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-gold">The Outcome</h3><p class="mt-3 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal">Policy frameworks that are practical, implementable and backed by data — designed to achieve real outcomes for the people and organisations they serve.</p></section></div></div></section><section class="section-y border-b border-ink-tint"><div class="shell"><section data-visible="false" class="reveal "><h2 class="font-display text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-ink md:text-[2.5rem]">Our Policy Advisory Clients</h2></section><section data-visible="false" class="reveal mt-8 grid gap-5 sm:grid-cols-2"><article class="flex h-full flex-col border border-ink-tint bg-card p-5 transition-colors hover:border-gold/60"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-building2 lucide-building-2 size-6 text-gold" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M10 12h4"></path><path d="M10 8h4"></path><path d="M14 21v-3a2 2 0 0 0-4 0v3"></path><path d="M6 10H4a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v7a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h16a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V9a2 2 0 0 0-2-2h-2"></path><path d="M6 21V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h8a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v16"></path></svg><h3 class="mt-4 font-display text-lg font-semibold leading-snug text-ink">Government Bodies</h3><p class="mt-2 flex-1 text-[16px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal">State and central government departments seeking evidence-based research and policy framework design for MSME and institutional development.</p></article><article class="flex h-full flex-col border border-ink-tint bg-card p-5 transition-colors hover:border-gold/60"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-users-round size-6 text-gold" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M18 21a8 8 0 0 0-16 0"></path><circle cx="10" cy="8" r="5"></circle><path d="M22 20c0-3.37-2-6.5-4-8a5 5 0 0 0-.45-8.3"></path></svg><h3 class="mt-4 font-display text-lg font-semibold leading-snug text-ink">Industry Associations</h3><p class="mt-2 flex-1 text-[16px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal">Industry bodies and trade associations requiring policy advocacy support, sector analysis and government liaison for their member businesses.</p></article><article class="flex h-full flex-col border border-ink-tint bg-card p-5 transition-colors hover:border-gold/60"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-graduation-cap size-6 text-gold" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M21.42 10.922a1 1 0 0 0-.019-1.838L12.83 5.18a2 2 0 0 0-1.66 0L2.6 9.08a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.832l8.57 3.908a2 2 0 0 0 1.66 0z"></path><path d="M22 10v6"></path><path d="M6 12.5V16a6 3 0